// Title: Enable Remote Connection Between Anonymous Computer - AllowAnonymousCallback
// Rule ID: 4d431012-2ab5-4db7-a84e-b29809da2172
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1562.001
// Category: registry_set
